WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.587
The Command Structure Report.

00:00:02.537 --> 00:00:11.162
RCMP Commissioner Bob Paulson held command when Bill C-14 received Royal Assent on June 17, 2016.

00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:18.100
Commissioner Brenda Lucki held command when Bill C-7 was enacted on March 17, 2021.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:26.562
In both instances, the sovereign authority capable of dismantling a state-sponsored termination apparatus chose absolute complicity.
